            "DialogCategory": "Growup",
            "VoiceClip": "Kotori_Growup_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_Kotori/kotori_growup_1",
            "LocalizeEN": "Why. I feel like my improvements in logical reasoning are greater than those of my guns."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 16002,
            "DialogCategory": "Growup",
            "VoiceClip": "Kotori_Growup_2",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_Kotori/kotori_growup_2",
            "LocalizeEN": "Compared with long-winded words and logic, I desire strength more."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 16002,
            "DialogCategory": "Growup",
            "VoiceClip": "Kotori_Growup_3",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_Kotori/kotori_growup_3",
            "LocalizeEN": "I don't want to be a talkative person. As long as I'm with Sensei, I should be fine."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 16002,
            "DialogCategory": "Growup",
            "VoiceClip": "Kotori_Growup_4",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_Kotori/kotori_growup_4",
            "LocalizeEN": "I can help those who suffer the pain of not knowing."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 16002,
            "DialogCategory": "Relationship",
