            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_Kotori/kotori_relationship_up_2",
            "LocalizeEN": "Every time I learn something new, my heart beats fast. And, when I'm with Sensei, I experience new emotions."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 16002,
            "DialogCategory": "Relationship",
            "VoiceClip": "Kotori_Relationship_Up_3",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_Kotori/kotori_relationship_up_3",
            "LocalizeEN": "I want to be a teacher someday, not just to give lectures, but to listen to students like Sensei."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 16002,
            "DialogCategory": "Relationship",
            "VoiceClip": "Kotori_Relationship_Up_4",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_Kotori/kotori_relationship_up_4",
            "LocalizeEN": "I should be able to explain everything, but my heart... Sorry, I can't explain it easily."
